    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Honestly, math has always been a bit of a struggle for me. I grew up with parents who had higher education, so there was pressure, but I just never clicked with numbers. I prefer literature and chemistry, which feel more natural. Now, math feels like another subject I skipped over, something I'd rather avoid unless absolutely necessary. It's that feeling of being left behind.",
